ed from puerto rico's ocean  [Music]  after the impact of hurricane maria we  really felt alone  but it really brought a lot of puerto  rico together  without the local knowledge of these  fishermen we would not have been able to  come together as a people to really  survive and move forward to see how  things can improve here and it's  something that we need to continue  recognizing not just for fishing  communities but for all response to  emergencies  [Music]  you

